Public project headers mirror the module hierarchy under src/:

    config/                 Build-time defaults
    keyboard/               Matrix, layout, encoder, and gesture interface
    usb/                    Host HID integration
    storage/                Persistent keystroke counter
    display/                Controller, panel transport, and status snapshot
    display/animations/     Scene interfaces, registry, timing, and math
    display/diagnostics/    Isolation renderer
    display/effects/        Milestone overlays
    display/widgets/       Status badges and capture text

Include headers using their category, for example:

    #include "keyboard/input_controller.h"

See ARCHITECTURE.md for ownership, dependencies, formatting, and verification.
